    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        318.0994873046875,
        527.3926391601562,
        332.5425109863281
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation was first put forward in 2010 and considered valid in the guidelines update",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        331.18951416015625,
        527.4271850585938,
        345.7425231933594
      ],
      "text": "Annex 1 of 2017 (see summary of recommendations in  ). The recommendation is copied without",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        344.49951171875,
        491.5469665527344,
        358.9425354003906
      ],
      "text": "modification into this consolidated document and appears exactly as in the 2010 guidelines.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        372.31671142578125,
        216.29168701171875,
        388.168701171875
      ],
      "text": "Justification and evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.3766174316406,
        527.5213623046875,
        409.81964111328125
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review and meta-analysis of 6 randomized controlled trials and 21 cohort studies",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        408.57659912109375,
        527.3890991210938,
        423.0196228027344
      ],
      "text": "provided pooled estimates of failure, relapse and death by duration of rifampicin, and daily intensive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        420.5006103515625,
        527.398681640625,
        436.2196350097656
      ],
      "text": "(41) phase versus intermittent throughout  . The systematic review revealed a marked and significant",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        434.9765930175781,
        527.447509765625,
        449.41961669921875
      ],
      "text": "reduction in failure and relapse in the arms where some or all patients received ART. In a regression",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        448.1766052246094,
        527.4312133789062,
        462.61962890625
      ],
      "text": "model, treatment failure or relapse was 1.8–2.5 times more likely with intermittent rather than daily",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        461.3766174316406,
        527.377197265625,
        475.81964111328125
      ],
      "text": "dosing in the intensive phase. Compared with 8 or more months of rifampicin, 2-month rifampicin",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        474.57659912109375,
        527.4521484375,
        489.0196228027344
      ],
      "text": "regimens carried a 3-fold higher risk of relapse and 6-month regimens carried a 2.2 -fold higher risk.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        487.776611328125,
        527.43212890625,
        502.2196350097656
      ],
      "text": "Extending treatment beyond 6 months is recommended by some expert groups in certain persons",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        500.9765625,
        527.4200439453125,
        515.4195556640625
      ],
      "text": "living with HIV and the meta-analysis showed that this is associated with significantly lower relapse",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        514.1766357421875,
        527.433349609375,
        528.61962890625
      ],
      "text": "rates. However, several other considerations were given greater weight. Separate regimens for TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        527.3765869140625,
        527.4432373046875,
        541.819580078125
      ],
      "text": "patients living with or without HIV would be very challenging in operational terms and could create",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        540.5765991210938,
        527.43994140625,
        555.0195922851562
      ],
      "text": "stigma. Other potential harms of extending treatment are acquired resistance to rifampicin, and a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        553.776611328125,
        494.99981689453125,
        568.2196044921875
      ],
      "text": "longer period during which ART options are limited (because of ART–rifampicin interactions).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
